$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=rectintjen  LOC_AFTER=?

* Jensen inequality on a rectangle: the modulus at an interior point of a function that factors as a holomorphic function times a product of linear factors is bounded by the frame bound times the ratio of the distance bounds, raised to the number of factors.

